SUMMARY:The Art of Gifting  |  Museum Store Sunday
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 10th National Museum Store Sunday at our free holiday market. You’ll find limited-time sales\, including a mega-sale on West Coast glass books. There’s holiday card and ornament making\, a family photo opportunity\, and live harp from Lo Wolf from noon to 2pm. Orders over $100 get a free Museum tote. Museum Members always save 10% on non-consignment Museum Store items. We will also have a Member-exclusive lounge with free giftwrapping and holiday treats—available to Museum Members at no charge! \nThe Art of Gifting | Museum Store Sunday features:\nBook Mega-Sale: West Coast Glass \n\nIn celebration of our current exhibition\, West Coast Glass\, take advantage this limited-time super sale of select Museum Store glass books\, including many features on Dale Chihuly.\n\nOpen Craft Parlor: Holiday Card Making \n\nAfter shopping for everyone on your list\, create your holiday cards with style\, as we provide materials and transform the Windgate Foundation Atrium into an open craft parlor.\n\nLive Music: Lo Wolf\, harpist \n\nFrom noon–2pm\, find delight in the soothing and memorable soundscapes of Lo Wolf\, local harpist.\n\nOrders over $100: Museum Tote Bag \n\nReceive a free Asheville Art Museum tote with every purchase more than $100.\n\nMember Lounge + Benefits \n\nMuseum Members are invited to join us in the John & Robin Horn Education Center\, as we transform the studio into a Member lounge–featuring a free gift-wrapping station\, refreshments\, and music.\nMuseum Members receive 10% discount on all non-consignment Museum Store products.\n\nExplore the unique offerings and products of the Museum Store and fulfill all of your holiday shopping needs in a single stop! \nBrowse the Museum Store \n 
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/holiday-market-extravaganza-museum-store-sunday/
LOCATION:NC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/Museum-Store-Sunday-Image-copy-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
