SUMMARY:Collectors' Circle | Acquisition Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Join us\, Collectors’ Circle Members\, as the time has come for our end-of-year celebration! \nAfter a year of social and educational gatherings\, the year-end acquisition dinner is the Circle’s biggest event. Collectors’ Circle Members are invited to the Museum for an evening of delicious food and artistic stewardship. \nAnnual purchases to grow the Museum’s Collection is made possible by the Collectors’ Circle yearly dues\, creating the Museum’s acquisition fund. The 2026 acquisition dinner features exciting catering by Céline & Company. \nRSVP by Email \nPending space available\, Collectors’ Circle Members are welcome to invite guests to the acquisition dinner for $100 each. If your guests have been invited with interest in joining this specialized group\, please contact our Membership Associate\, Annabeth Hannaford\, at ahannaford@ashevilleart.org or 828-253-3227 x117. \nFor more information and a look at previous acquisitions\, visit our Collectors’ Circle page. \nRSVP by Email
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/collectors-circle-acquisition-dinner/
LOCATION:NC
CATEGORIES:Benefit Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/table-set-up-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
